ssion to my existing Agent Computer.\u003cbr\u003e\nDo NOT rebuild/reset unless necessary. iOS still works and the bots are there.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I see\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiOS Grok Bot: same account, works.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMac Grok Bot 0.43.0 (upgraded from 0.30.0): cannot attach to the existing cloud computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCurrent UI: cannot connect to your computer. Retry plus Restore Computer. Retry does nothing.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn-app Send Feedback also fails: cannot submit this report.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI did not tap Restore or Reset.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is not the cloud computer being down. If it were, iOS would fail too.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis is not firewall / VPN / Zscaler blocking \u003ca href=\"http://star.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003estar.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e. That 0.43.0 error copy is wrong on this Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Mac app gateway/session path is broken. That is why both connect-to-computer and submit-feedback fail on desktop only.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnvironment\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrok Bot desktop 0.43.0 stable, darwin arm64\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePreviously 0.30.0 stuck on black screen plus white loading circle after an update on Aug 30\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003emacOS 26.4.1, Apple M4\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCursor IDE on this same Mac works\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone Asia/Shanghai UTC+8\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInvestigation\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.30.0 logs on Aug 30\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003edesktop startup ready\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eedge_failed area cursor-profile, ConnectError.Unknown\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ebase_url_kind unknown\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ebox_reachability ControlPortCallError hundreds of times\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ebox_secrets.push host_unreachable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eForum match\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSame symptom: iOS OK, Mac loading/black after update\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStaff on topic 169940: cloud computer is healthy; Mac desktop cannot open a session\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStaff: rebuild will not help if the box is fine\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo product-wide fix announcement as of Sep 5\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003col start=\"3\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAfter upgrade to 0.43.0 on Sep 5\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFirst screen blamed firewall/VPN/Zscaler and \u003ca href=\"http://star.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003estar.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLater screen: cannot connect to your computer, bots are still there\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLocal profile has no gateway descriptor\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn-app feedback submit fails on the same desktop channel\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003col start=\"4\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNetwork checks. The firewall story is false.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis account box hostname is already visible on this Mac:\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"http://1b385416305d464f8fb3-pod-wxpkq5gbj5a4rfuogrcciek5my-1340.us9.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e1b385416305d464f8fb3-pod-wxpkq5gbj5a4rfuogrcciek5my-1340.us9.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolves, TLS 1.3 OK, cert CN \u003ca href=\"http://us9.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eus9.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e, SAN \u003ca href=\"http://star.us9.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003estar.us9.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGET slash returns 404, same as \u003ca href=\"http://test.us8.cursorvm.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003etest.us8.cursorvm.com\u003c/a\u003e (staff said 404 means connect worked)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eapi2.cursor.sh returns 200\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVersioned 0.43.0 dmg on \u003ca href=\"http://downloads.cursor.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003edownloads.cursor.com\u003c/a\u003e sand path returns 200\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn-app update index on that CDN returns S3 403 listing denied. That is why check-update fails. I already installed 0.43.0 manually.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo this Mac can reach the us9 cursorvm host and api2. The desktop client still cannot attach a session or submit feedback.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAsk\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReattach this Mac session / gateway binding to the existing Agent Computer above.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDo not rebuild unless you confirm the computer is actually stuck. Keep the iOS bots.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlease check why desktop in-app feedback cannot be submitted on this session.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T14:18:22.398Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":5.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170702,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0430-mac-desktop-session-broken-ios-works","display_username":"jian ma","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://star.cursorvm.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"http://1b385416305d464f8fb3-pod-wxpkq5gbj5a4rfuogrcciek5my-1340.us9.cursorvm.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"http://us9.cursorvm.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"http://star