and restarted the desktop app\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSigned out and back in\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated Grokbot’s Agent Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSwitched the Mac from normal Wi-Fi to an iPhone hotspot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetried the affected conversation multiple times\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNone of those changed the behavior.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMeanwhile:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGrokbot is still running and doing work in the cloud\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiOS shows the current conversation correctly\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCommands sent to the bot are still being received/executed\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOnly the macOS desktop conversation view seems stale / unable to reattach or refresh\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis makes it look more like a desktop conversation/session synchronization or attachment issue than an Agent Computer or network problem.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHappy to provide logs or other diagnostics if the team wants anything specific checked.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T20:56:59.933Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":0.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":170702,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0430-mac-desktop-session-broken-ios-works","display_username":"N N","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136357,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-